          %h2#references References
          %p
            Early discussion of the possibility of a kind of 9-brane in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/11d+supergravity"} 11d supergravity
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mike+J.+Duff"}> Mike J. Duff
                , p. 28 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supermembranes
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9611203"} arXiv:hep-th/9611203
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+S.+Howe"}> Paul S. Howe
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ergin+Sezgin"} Ergin Sezgin
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Superbranes
                %strong 390
                (1997) 133-142 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9607227"}> arXiv:hep-th/9607227
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0370-2693(96)01416-5"} doi:10.1016/S0370-2693(96)01416-5
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mees+de+Roo"}> Mees de Roo
                , p. 5 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Intersecting branes and Supersymmetry
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supersymmetry and Quantum Field Theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9703124"} arXiv:hep-th/9703124
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0105225"} doi:10.1007/BFb0105225
            %li#Hull97
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Hull"}> Chris Hull
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Gravitational Duality, Branes and Charges
                %strong 509
                (1998) 216-251 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9705162"}> arXiv:hep-th/9705162
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0550-3213(97)00501-4"} doi:10.1016/S0550-3213(97)00501-4
          %p
            On M9-branes (and apparently introducing that terminology) as lifts of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D8-branes"} D8-branes
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/massive+type+IIA+string+theory"} massive type IIA string theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+Bergshoeff"}> Eric Bergshoeff
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yolanda+Lozano"} Yolanda Lozano
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tomas+Ortin"} Tomas Ortin
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Massive Branes
                %strong 518
                (1998) 363-423 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9712115"}> arXiv:hep-th/9712115
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0550-3213(98)00045-5"} doi:10.1016/S0550-3213(98)00045-5
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+Bergshoeff"}> Eric Bergshoeff
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jan+Pieter+van+der+Schaar"} Jan Pieter van der Schaar
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On M-9-branes
                %strong 16
                (1999) 23-39 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9806069"}> arXiv:hep-th/9806069
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/0264-9381/16/1/002"} doi:10.1088/0264-9381/16/1/002
          %p Further discussion:
          %ul
            %li
              M. P. Garcia del Moral, P. Leon, A. Restuccia,
              %em Wordsheet description of a
              massive
              %em type IIA superstring in 10D
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.16620"}> arXiv:2306.16620
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            A proposal for a description of the M9 as an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/infinity-Wess-Zumino-Witten+theory"} higher WZW theory
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              Takeshi Sato,
              = succeed "," do
                %em A 10-form Gauge Potential and an M-9-brane Wess-Zumino Action in Massive 11D Theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9912030"} arXiv:hep-th/9912030
          %p
            Discussion of how the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-brane"} M2-brane
            and the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            may arise from this by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tachyon+condensation"} tachyon condensation
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Laurent+Houart"}> Laurent Houart
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yolanda+Lozano"} Yolanda Lozano
              = succeed "," do
                %em Brane Descent Relations in M-theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0001170"} arXiv:hep-th/0001170
          %p
            Discussion of the M9 as the dual in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Horava-Witten+theory"} Horava-Witten theory
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/O8-planes"} O8-planes
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+II+string+theory"} type II string theory
            is in
          %ul
            %li#GKSTY02
              E. Gorbatov, V.S. Kaplunovsky, J. Sonnenschein,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Theisen"} Stefan Theisen
              = succeed "," do
                %em On Heterotic Orbifolds, M Theory and Type I’ Brane Engineering
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0108135"} arXiv:hep-th/0108135
          %p
            see also at
            %em
              %a{:href => "intersecting+D-brane+model#IntersectionOfD6WithO8"} Intersection of D6s with O8s
          %p
            Cohomological discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ninebrane+structures"} ninebrane structures
            is in
          %ul
            %li#Sati14
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"}> Hisham Sati
              ,
              %em Ninebrane structures
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1405.7686"}> arXiv:1405.7686
              )
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Howe"}> Paul Howe
                , A. Kaya,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ergin+Sezgin"} Ergin Sezgin
                %em Codimension One Branes
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0001169"}> arXiv:hep-th/0001169
                )
            %li#MoorePeradzeSaulina04
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gregory+Moore"}> Gregory Moore
                , Grigor Peradze,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Natalia+Saulina"} Natalia Saulina
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Instabilities in heterotic M-theory induced by open membrane instantons
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0012104"} arXiv:hep-th/0012104
            %li
              %p
                Takeshi Sato,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On M-9-branes and their dimensional reductions
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0102084"} arXiv:hep-th/0102084
          %p
            Discussion of open
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-branes"} M5-branes
            ending on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M9-brane"} M9-brane
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+Bergshoeff"}> Eric Bergshoeff
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gary+Gibbons"} Gary Gibbons
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Townsend"} Paul Townsend
              = succeed "," do
                %em Open M5-branes
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0607193"} arXiv:hep-th/0607193
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.97.231601"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.97.231601
          %p
            Discussion as
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exotic+branes"} exotic branes
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exceptional+field+theory"} exceptional field theory
          %ul
            %li#ObersPioline99
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Niels+Obers"}> Niels Obers
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Boris+Pioline"} Boris Pioline
              = succeed "," do
                %em U-duality and M-Theory
              %strong 318
              (1999) 113-225 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9809039"}> arXiv:hep-th/9809039
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0370-1573(99)00004-6"} doi:10.1016/S0370-1573(99)00004-6
          %blockquote
            %p p. 109: “conjectured M9-brane which should more properly be called M8-brane.”
          %ul
            %li#BermanMusaevOtsuki18
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+S.+Berman"}> David S. Berman
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edvard+T.+Musaev"} Edvard T. Musaev
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ray+Otsuki"} Ray Otsuki
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Exotic Branes in Exceptional Field Theory:
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msub
                            %mi E
                            %mrow
                              %mn 7
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                              %mn 7
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E_{7(7)}
                    and Beyond
                %strong 2018
                53 (2018) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1806.00430"}> arXiv:1806.00430
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/JHEP12(2018)053"} doi:10.1007/JHEP12(2018)053
              %blockquote
                %p
                  %a{:href => "#BermanMusaevOtsuki18"}> Berman, Musaev &amp; Otsuki (2018), p. 65
                  \: “However, as remarked in
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "#ObersPioline99"} 1
